    {
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Two-tier oracle for `nucleide.spectroscopy`: synthetic E1-E9 gates on hand-built fixtures (tier 1, always run), and a cross-check against the upstream `pyne.spectanalysis` / `pyne.gammaspec` routines and `pyne.source.PointSource.mcnp` on identical runtime inputs (tier 2)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "E1 rect m=5: worst rel err 0.000e+00 (hand values)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "E2 five-point: worst rel err 0.000e+00 (hand values)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "E7 golden: 6-coefficient fit-1 efficiency at 1 MeV."
    },
    {
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "E7-fit fit1_degree2: coefficient recovery worst rel err 6.939e-15."
    },
    {
